      "summary": "All-or-nothing instead of partial success",
      "rationale": "Single transaction; any invalid entry rejects the batch | alternatives: [207 Multi-Status with per-item results] | consequences: Simple client semantics for spreadsheet imports; one bad row requires resubmitting the batch."
    },
